 "words": 188,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Early in the morning, the landowner went",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To hire some workers, a denarius was meant",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.34,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "At the third hour, at the sixth and the ninth",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He went to the marketplace, he called them in line",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.82,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "At the eleventh hour some were standing around",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Why have you been standing here idle all day",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.15,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Because no one has hired us, the men all replied",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.18,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You also go into the vineyard, he said with a smile",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So the last will be first",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the first last",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.73,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Grace is not wages",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.91,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Grace is a gift that holds fast",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "When evening came, they lined up for pay",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The last ones got a denarius for one hour of the day",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The first ones grumbled, we bore the scorching heat",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.57,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Friend, I am doing you no wrong, take what is yours and eat",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So the last will be first",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.54,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the first last",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Grace is not wages",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.88,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Grace is a gift that holds fast",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Am I not allowed to do what I want with what is mine",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Or are you envious because I am generous",
